# Requests for the REST Client in VS / VS Code / Rider. Run the "http" launch profile first.
@host = http://localhost:5053

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### All birds
GET {{host}}/api/birds

### Log in (copy the token into @token below)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "your-user", "password": "your-password" }

###
@token = paste-token-here

### Delete a bird (Admin)
DELETE {{host}}/api/birds/000000000000000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Latest cached weather
GET {{host}}/api/weather/latest
